        "original_id": "e165c05e-0727-5e15-9a75-15ba21bbbaea",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tahmoh Penikett, Joss Whedon\n- TV Series: Supernatural, Dollhouse, Continuum, Buffy the Vampire Slayer, Angel, Firefly, Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D., Battlestar Galactica\n- Companies: Mutant Enemy Productions, Bellwether Pictures\n- Characters: Karl C. Agathon\n- Episodes: Meet Jane Doe\n\nFacts:\n- Joss Whedon founded Mutant Enemy Productions and co-founded Bellwether Pictures.\n- Joss Whedon created the television series Buffy the Vampire Slayer, which ran from 1997 to 2003.\n- Joss Whedon created the television series Angel, which ran from 1999 to 2004.\n- Joss Whedon created the television series Firefly, which debuted in 2002.\n- Joss Whedon created the television series Dollhouse, which ran from 2009 to 2010.\n- Joss Whedon created the television series Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D., which began in 2013.\n- Tahmoh Penikett starred in the television series Supernatural, Dollhouse, and Continuum.\n- Tahmoh Penikett portrayed Karl C. Agathon, also known by the callsign Helo, on the re-imagined Battlestar Galactica television series.\n- Meet Jane Doe is the seventh episode of Dollhouse season two and the 20th episode of the series overall.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "56f1bc47-cc36-5a86-b166-033d55cc8f67",
        "text": "Page: Tahmoh Penikett. Sentence: He has starred in TV series \"Supernatural\", Joss Whedon's \"Dollhouse\", and the Showtime time travel show, \"Continuum\".\nPage: Joss Whedon. Sentence: He is the founder of Mutant Enemy Productions and co-founder of Bellwether Pictures, and is best known as the creator of the television series \"Buffy the Vampire Slayer\" (1997–2003), \"Angel\" (1999–2004), \"Firefly\" (2002), \"Dollhouse\" (2009–10) and \"Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.\" (from 2013).\nPage: Karl Agathon. Sentence: Karl C. Agathon (callsign \"Helo\") is a fictional character on the re-imagined \"Battlestar Galactica\" TV series, portrayed by Tahmoh Penikett.\nPage: Meet Jane Doe. Sentence: \"Meet Jane Doe\" is the seventh episode of the second season of the American science fiction television series \"Dollhouse\" and the show's 20th episode overall.",
